<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arti - 28,000 tonnes urea Brunsbuttel/WC India $33.50 fio 6,000/1,200 option Kandla $32.50 1,500 discharge 21-25/4 Indian government.</p>
<p>Saint Ioannis - 13,000 tonnes urea Marsa el Brega/India $31.50 fio 6,000/1,200 option Kandla $30.50 fio 1,500 discharge 16-18/4 Indian government.</p>
</text>
